This is TLDR version of the EULA for zekton font.

The User may Use the Font Software to create,edit,view,print,
and distribute materials for commercial or non-commercial purposes
provided that the distributed materials should not contain font
software and should not provide glyphs or glyph outlines so that
an software can render them.The user can distribute a Non-commercial
PDF containing embedded Font Software if:
1. The PDF is non-editable by its recipient using the embedded
Font Software.
2. The Font Software cannot be fully or partially extracted
from the PDF.
3. The PDF does not enable a recipient to compose new text with
the Font Software.

Permitted finished materials include print, logos, packaging,
merchandise, presentations, images, and rendered audiovisual
content, provided they meet the conditions above. A recipient may
receive the finished result but not a reusable font capability.
